PR title: Cleanup + fixes + React 18 + dark mode
PR description:
Big cleanup sprint branch. Switches us to the new logger, fixes the invoice rounding bug (BUG-431), bumps React 17 -> 18, and adds dark mode. Also renames a bunch of files.
